<title>USA: Dailey Pete to buy Phoenix Drilling.</title>
<headline>Dailey Pete to buy Phoenix Drilling.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dailey Petroleum Services Corp said it agreed to buy Houston-based Phoenix Drilling Services Inc for about $67 million cash.</p>
<p>Phoenix provides short radius drilling and horizontal directional drilling, standard directional drilling &amp; surveying, slim hole drilling &amp; boring services.</p>
<p>Dailey said it expects the deal to increase market share and distribution of its directional drilling services and downhole tools.</p>
</text>
